      "message": "This runs in both branches of create_app, not just production. When test_config is passed (e.g. TestingConfig) the conf key still wins and overwrites any SECRET_KEY the test config set, or raises RuntimeError if conf/quads.yml has no quads_api_secret_key. The new tests here dodge it by monkeypatching Config, but a caller that hands a test config its own SECRET_KEY will get it silently replaced. Consider returning early with the test config\u0027s key when test_config is provided, or only reading the conf key on the production path.",
